{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3e\u00a0Claw your way to glory in this fast-paced 2D platformer-shooter adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a fearless feline on a mission through <strong>six action-packed worlds</strong>, each teeming with enemies, hazards, and hidden treasures. Jump, slide, and blast your way through vibrant retro-style levels, collecting <strong>coins and rare gems</strong> to upgrade your abilities and become more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/6df78d202be88e28bb9511a4a45e1b4f.apng?t=1761782816\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/6df78d202be88e28bb9511a4a45e1b4f.poster.avif?t=1761782816\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/d435702a836fff8a7ea95b4f4ca144a0.poster.avif?t=1761782816\" width=128 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/d435702a836fff8a7ea95b4f4ca144a0.webm?t=1761782816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/f1ca4b12e56e284ea3531c3babcd8769.poster.avif?t=1761782816\" width=64 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/f1ca4b12e56e284ea3531c3babcd8769.webm?t=1761782816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With tight controls, challenging platforming, and explosive combat, every level is a test of skill and reflexes. Upgrade your cat's powers\u2014from a basic pistol to a fully automatic weapon, double jumps and bubble shield \u2014 as you prepare to face off against world bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual cat lover or a hardcore arcade veteran, this game delivers the perfect mix of challenge, charm, and chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Bonus Content &amp; Minigames</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019re done? Think again. Beat the first five worlds to unlock a hidden vault of <strong>nine bonus arcade-style minigames</strong> and an additional world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your reflexes and rack up high scores in quirky trials like <strong>Coconut Catch</strong>, where timing is everything, or <strong>Ice Climb</strong>, a vertical sprint through slippery chaos, Test your limits in <strong>Endless Horde</strong> \u2014 survive as long as possible against waves featuring almost every enemy in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each minigame offers a fresh twist on the core mechanics, complete with <strong>online leaderboards</strong> so you can compete with friends and claw your way to the top. These bite-sized challenges keep the fun going long after the final boss is defeated.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf3e New in Update 2.00 \u2014</strong> <strong>The\u00a0Farm!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all that blasting and boss fighting, take a breather on your very own <strong>farm</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/32c2c2f2b22f3497de91af67cfa9419e.apng?t=1761782816\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/32c2c2f2b22f3497de91af67cfa9419e.poster.avif?t=1761782816\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/d7a71d0e9325234ec79b05968332d6d4.apng?t=1761782816\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/d7a71d0e9325234ec79b05968332d6d4.poster.avif?t=1761782816\" class=\"bb_img\" width=52 height=64 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/294e128651b55dd1d638af93a5356557.apng?t=1761782816\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/294e128651b55dd1d638af93a5356557.poster.avif?t=1761782816\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops for profit, customize your land with  decorations, and collect adorable (and sometimes strange) animal companions. Complete farm tasks, upgrade your facilities, and even collect rare critters from other worlds once you unlock the stables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The farm is your cozy corner of calm between the chaos \u2014 a place to relax, earn rewards, and make your mark.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cat Gunner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819280/7af892b5d67f980a4d9b3ab024f0acea82ae16fc.jpg"},{"name":"W1 Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819280/87a8a674a008ef07b05993d4b0a75e1c514840c9.jpg"},{"name":"W2 Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819280/a7040d70c7815e62365d26c9aa58f2f2b712b05b.jpg"},{"name":"W3 Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819280/4e7c951e6be60be296881845d134f2a84e39cb61.jpg"},{"name":"W4 Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamsta