ade your cat's powers\u2014from a basic pistol to a fully automatic weapon, double jumps and bubble shield \u2014 as you prepare to face off against world bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual cat lover or a hardcore arcade veteran, this game delivers the perfect mix of challenge, charm, and chaos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Bonus Content &amp; Minigames</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019re done? Think again. Beat the first five worlds to unlock a hidden vault of <strong>nine bonus arcade-style minigames</strong> and an additional world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your reflexes and rack up high scores in quirky trials like <strong>Coconut Catch</strong>, where timing is everything, or <strong>Ice Climb</strong>, a vertical sprint through slippery chaos, Test your limits in <strong>Endless Horde</strong> \u2014 survive as long as possible against waves featuring almost every enemy in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each minigame offers a fresh twist on the core mechanics, complete with <strong>online leaderboards</strong> so you can compete with friends and claw your way to the top. These bite-sized challenges keep the fun going long after the final boss is defeated.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf3e New in Update 2.00 \u2014</strong> <strong>The\u00a0Farm!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all that blasting and boss fighting, take a breather on your very own <strong>farm</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/32c2c2f2b22f3497de91af67cfa9419e.apng?t=1761782816\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819280/extras/32c2c2f2b22f3497de91af67cfa9419e.poster.avif?t=1761782816\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_